      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.principals.$principalId.machine-credentials",
      "path": "/system/principals/:principalId/machine-credentials",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:write - step-up後にcredentialを失効し履歴を保持する",
      "exportName": "DELETE",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.machine-credentials.$credentialId",
      "path": "/system/principals/:principalId/machine-credentials/:credentialId",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 明示した閲覧権限・申請判断の関係・開示監査を満たす提案版だけを読む",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.proposals.$number.versions.$version",
      "path": "/system/proposals/:number/versions/:version",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:read - namespaced permissionを持つSystem Roleだけを読む",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.roles",
      "path": "/system/roles",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:write - actorが保持しないpermissionをRoleへ追加できない",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.roles",
      "path": "/system/roles",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:write - active bindingを持つRoleとmanaged Roleは削除しない",
      "exportName": "DELETE",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.roles.$roleId",
      "path": "/system/roles/:roleId",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:read - 一つのSystem Roleをpermission集合付きで読む",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.roles.$roleId",
      "path": "/system/roles/:roleId",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "permission iam:write - managed Role不変・permission昇格・last-rootを検査する",
      "exportName": "PATCH",
      "method": "PATCH",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.roles.$roleId",
      "path": "/system/roles/:roleId",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "public - tokenの実在を漏らさずSession familyを冪等失効する",
      "exportName": "DELETE",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.sessions",
      "path": "/system/sessions",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "public - opaque Session token自体をcredentialとして検証する",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.sessions",
      "path": "/system/sessions",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "public - refresh tokenのrotationと再利用検知をSystemが行う",
      "exportName": "PATCH",
      "method": "PATCH",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.sessions",
      "path": "/system/sessions",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "public - password credentialを検証しcanonical opaque Sessionを発行する",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.sessions",
      "path": "/system/sessions",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "authenticated - 現在のHuman Accountのpasswordを再検証して短命grantを発行する",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.step-up-grants",
      "path": "/system/step-up-grants",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 現在の参加者または管理者に作業一覧を限定する",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items",
      "path": "/system/work-items",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 作業の依頼と責任者を記録する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items",
      "path": "/system/work-items",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 現在の参加者または管理者に作業の最新版を開示する",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 担当者が作業を受領する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.accept",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/accept",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 責任者が正確な成果を確認し作業を完了する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.approve",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/approve",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 責任者が作業の中止を記録する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.cancel",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/cancel",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 現在の参加資格・証拠の完全性・開示監査を確認して添付を渡す",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.evidence.$attachmentId",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/evidence/:attachmentId",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 受領が必要な責任の引き継ぎを依頼する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.handovers",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/handovers",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 引き継ぎ先が作業の責任を受領する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.handovers.accept",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/handovers/accept",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 引き継ぎ先が受領を辞退する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.handovers.decline",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/handovers/decline",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 現在の参加者または管理者に変更不能な作業履歴を開示する",
      "exportName": "GET",
      "method": "GET",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.history",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/history",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 担当者が確認対象の成果を提出する。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.results",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/results",
      "phase": "public",
    },
    {
      "authorization": "service - 責任者が成果の修正を求める。",
      "exportName": "POST",
      "method": "POST",
      "module": "@system/interface/routes/system.work-items.$id.return",
      "path": "/system/work-items/:id/return",
      "phase": "public",
    },
  ],
}
`;
